<http://data.silknow.org/object/7a6319a0-b180-372b-97d2-76ed83acc28f/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Pair of shoes of ivory-coloure satin. They have square toes, the soles are shaped at the instep, and there is no heel. There are small satin bows upon the plain uppers, and long elastic loops for securing the shoes at the ankle. They are trimmed wth cream-coloured silk ribbon, and lined with white kid and light blue cotton."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/7a6319a0-b180-372b-97d2-76ed83acc28f> .

